# --- Secretos y entorno (nunca versionar) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# El panel en modo simulado solo trae VITE_USAR_MOCK=1 (no es un secreto).
!proyecto/panel-asesor/.env.mock
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
!**/infra/docker/healthcheck/**

# --- Node (front Lovable, conductas, contrato, spike) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.output/
**/.vinxi/
**/.tanstack/
**/.nitro/
**/.wrangler/
**/.dev.vars
*.local

# --- Go ---
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/bin/

# --- Editor / OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log
logs/

# --- Cursor (local del IDE) ---
.cursor/

# --- Artefactos locales de build Docker ---
**/.docker/

# --- Sync / respaldos locales ---
proyecto/_sync/
**/*.tgz
